## 🗄️ Database Architecture

### Connection Details (`database.py`)
| Parameter | Value | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **RDBMS** | MySQL | Relational Database Management System |
| **Driver** | `pymysql` | Pure-Python MySQL client library |
| **Host & Port** | `localhost:3306` | Local database server endpoint |
| **Database Name** | `project` | Target database schema |
| **Table Name** | `cloths` | Primary ORM table for customer measurements |

### Table Schema (`models.py`)
| Column Name | SQLAlchemy Type | Pydantic Type | Constraints | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `id` | `Integer` | `int` | `PRIMARY KEY` | Auto-incrementing unique customer ID |
| `name` | `String(100)` | `str` | `NOT NULL` | Customer's full name |
| `phno` | `BigInteger` / `Integer` | `int` | `UNIQUE`, `NOT NULL` | 10-digit customer phone number |
| `shirt_shoulder` | `Integer` | `int` | `NULLABLE` | Shirt shoulder width measurement |
| `shirt_length` | `Integer` | `int` | `NULLABLE` | Full shirt length measurement |
| `shirt_hand` | `String(25)` | `str` | `NULLABLE` | Sleeve length/style (e.g., `Full Hand`, `Forearm-length`) |
| `pants_length` | `Integer` | `int` | `NULLABLE` | Trouser outseam length |
| `pants_style` | `String(100)` | `str` | `NULLABLE` | Trouser fit style (e.g., `Ankle Fit`, `Regular`) |
| `pants_waist` | `Integer` | `int` | `NULLABLE` | Trouser waist size |

