## 🔌 REST API Reference (`main.py`)

| HTTP Method | Endpoint | Function Name | Request Body (`schemas.py`) | Response Model | Status Codes | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `POST` | `/users` | `create_user()` | `UserCreate` (JSON) | `UserResponse` | `200 OK`, `422 Unprocessable Entity` | Creates a new customer measurement record |
| `GET` | `/users` | `get_user()` | *None* | `list[UserCreate]` | `200 OK` | Fetches a list of all customer measurement records |
| `GET` | `/users/{user_id}` | `get_user()` | *None* (Path Param: `user_id`) | `UserResponse` | `200 OK`, `404 Not Found` | Fetches a specific customer's record by their `id` |
| `PUT` | `/users/{user_id}` | `update()` | `UserCreate` (JSON) | `UserResponse` | `200 OK`, `404 Not Found`, `422` | Updates an existing customer's record by `id` |
| `DELETE` | `/users/{user_id}` | `delete()` | *None* (Path Param: `user_id`) | JSON Message | `200 OK`, `404 Not Found` | Permanently deletes a customer's record by `id` |
